<p>Chehlum manane qafela, le aayi hai zainab</p>

<p>Baazare sham se, darbaare sham se,<br />
Zindaane Sham se,<br />
Ho aayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
1) Guzre jo sitam mujh pe wo, kaise bataau mai<br />
Roodaad taaziyaano ki, kaise sunaau mai<br />
Baazu pe nishaa'n rassi ke, le aayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
2) Armaane rehai thi liye, qaide sham me<br />
Cheeni hai qaza ne use, yu'n qaide sham me<br />
Khokar teri sakina ko, lo aayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
3) bhai sunaau tum ko mai, kya kya sitam hue<br />
Oonto'n ki nangi pusht pe, alhe haram phire<br />
Sab ko qabar thi aapki, maajayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
4) Sajjade hazee'n touqo salaasal me tha jakda<br />
Chaale pade the paao me, milo'n ka safar tha<br />
Us par jo sitam toote na, seh paayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
5) Sar kat the hi bas aapka, cheeni gayi chaadar<br />
Sab itrate at'haar the, balwe me khule sar<br />
Is zulm pe sar qam kiye, tharraayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
6) Kis tarha ho bayaa'n sohail, ab daastaane gham<br />
Qabro pe sabhi bibiyaa'n, karne lage maatam<br />
Har ek sitam pe raah me, ghabraayi hai zainab</p>

<p>
7) bibi dua ye karte hai, sab naasere aza<br />
Bulwaalo hind se hame, ab jald karbala<br />
Lab par ho nouha haaye kya, dukh paayi hai zainab<br />
</p>